{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1538204-notes-on-lineages-families","id":1538204,"title":"Notes on Lineages/Families","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Curseborne"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-07T07:33:54-07:00","id":1538204,"title":"Notes on Lineages/Families","content":"Note: These are my personal notes from watching the Curseborne Character creation videos. There may be some mistakes or missing information.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Dead</b></u> - Seek out specific emotions.<ul><li><b>Fury (Emotion - Anger)</b></li> <li><b>Shade (Emotion - Sadness)</b></li> <li><b>Poltergeist (Emotion - Fear)</b></li> <li><b>Wardens (Emotion - Desperation)</b></li> <li><b>Mavens (Emotion - Exhilaration/Thrill)</b></li> <li><b>Zeds (Emotion - Closure)</b></li> </ul><u><b>Hungry</b></u> - Feed on a specific things.<ul><li><b>The Black Hearts (Hunger - Emotions) (Also known as Dhampir in quiz)</b></li> <li><b>Gaki (Hunger - Ghosts)</b></li> <li><b>Heirs (Hunger - Power? Not stated in episode)</b></li> <li><b>House Bathory (Hunger - Blood Bathing)</b></li> <li><b>Iscariots (Hunger - Greater Good? Not stated in episode)</b></li> <li><b>Vorare (Hunger - Souls)</b></li> <li><b>Ascetics (Hunger - Knowledge? Not stated in episode)</b></li> </ul><u><b>Primal</b></u> - Have an internal creature that wants them to attack. (Note most of this info comes from another forum from Danielle)<ul><li><b>Get of Lyka (Creature - Wolf)</b></li> <li><b>Hyde (Creature - Inhuman)</b></li> <li><b>Raptor (Creature - Bird/Reptile)</b></li> <li><b>Sphinx (Creature - Cat)</b></li> <li><b>Spawn of Vodnik (Creature - Aquatic)</b></li> <li><b>Eight Hands (Creature - Spider)</b></li> </ul><u><b>Outcast </b></u>- Seek out connections/bonds with mortals to gain more power.<ul><li><b>Nephilim - Travel outsides to gain information and secrets.</b></li> <li><b>Battlefield Angel - Actively seek to go into Battlegrounds.</b></li> <li><b>League of the Hidden Crossroads - All about tempting people with devil\u2019s bargains.</b></li> <li><b>Keeper of the Broken Vine - Commune with Nature</b></li> <li><b>Chimera - Got Cursed for trying to find Godhood. Have a visible mutation.</b></li> <li><b>Munificent - Grant people\u2019s wishes like a genie to help people.</b></li> </ul>\u200b<u><b>Sorcerer </b></u>- Sacrifice something to cast magic more reliably.<ul><li><b>Archivists (Sacrifice - Knowledge)</b></li> <li><b>Faceless (Sacrifice - Fame)</b></li> <li><b>Premiere (Sacrifice - Time)</b></li> <li><b>Network (Sacrifice - Social Connections)</b></li> <li><b>Reeves (Sacrifice - Life/Death)</b></li> <li><b>Unburdened (Sacrifice - Material Possessions)</b></li> </ul>In the OPP discord it was confirmed that satisfying your Damnation can be done to regain Curse dice even when you still have Curse dice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}